# UADS Cursor rules

UADS (Universal Autonomous Development Studio) is a NexLabs project.

## Architecture Freeze v0.2

- Global-first: operational state under `~/.uads/`, never in the managed project by default.
- Zero project footprint: no caches, work orders, indexes, or review ZIPs in-repo unless explicitly opted in.
- Evidence-first: completion claims need commands, outputs, or files.
- Review ZIPs must exclude secrets and heavy directories.
- Do not implement the full orchestrator, specialist agents, marketplace, or deep UGAS integration in Prompt 001 leftovers.

## CLI

Foundation commands: `uads --help`, `uads doctor`, `uads status`, `uads review`.

## Docs

Normative docs live in `docs/`. Extra ideas go to `docs/14-BACKLOG.md`.
